WEBVTT

00:00:03.377 --> 00:00:05.344
<b>They’re having</b> a party next door.

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:08.000
Oh no! <b>The baby’s crying</b>.

00:00:08.533 --> 00:00:09.603
<b>It’s raining</b>.

00:00:11.916 --> 00:00:12.785
<v><b>A:</b></v> What <b>are you doing</b>?

00:00:13.283 --> 00:00:14.852
<v><b>B:</b></v> <b>I’m waiting</b> for my brother.